Brand hardware setup and testing log
title end

paragraph start
Every new device gets a short log: what was set up, what was tested and whether it passed. A failed test is recorded with what was tried.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The log is the only record of why a device was kept or sent back, so write it the same day.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
device, date, set up steps done, test, result, next action
code end

paragraph start
todo: start the log with the first device
Open until the owner decides.
